# MOST ALSA configuration
#

config AIM_SOUND
	tristate "ALSA AIM"
	depends on SND
	---help---
	  Say Y here if you want to commumicate via ALSA/sound devices.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called aim_sound.
